        "chunks": [
          {
            "arabic_text": "اَلْحُسَيْنُ بْنُ سَعِيدٍ عَنْ فَضَالَةَ عَنْ إِسْمَاعِيلَ بْنِ أَبِي زِيَادٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنْ عَلِيٍّ عَلَيْهِ ٱلسَّلَامُ",
            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Al-Husayn ibn Sa'id, from Fadalah, from Isma'il ibn Abi Ziyad, from Abi 'Abdillah, from his father, from 'Ali عليه السلام.",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 20,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "«أَنَّهُ أُتِيَ بِٱمْرَأَةٍ بِكْرٍ زَعَمُوا أَنَّهَا زَنَتْ فَأَمَرَ ٱلنِّسَاءَ فَنَظَرْنَ إِلَيْهَا فَقُلْنَ هِيَ عَذْرَاءُ فَقَالَ",
            "chunk_type": "opening",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "“That a virgin woman was brought to him, and they alleged that she had committed zina. So he ordered the women, and they looked at her and said: She is a virgin. Then he said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 35,
            "word_start": 20
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ ٱلسَّلَامُ «مَا كُنْتُ لِأَضْرِبَ مَنْ عَلَيْهَا خَاتَمٌ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ وَكَانَ يُجِيزُ شَهَادَةَ ٱلنِّسَاءِ فِي مِثْلِ هَذَا»",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "'Ali عليه السلام said: “I would not strike one upon whom there is a seal from Allah, and he used to deem the testimony of women valid in the like of this.”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 53,
            "word_start": 35
          }
        ],
        "content_type": "legal_ruling",
